uu9qk" data-uniq-id="mzvSs" data-generated-css="brz-css-vWQij"><strong style="color: rgb(49, 51, 71);">The Green Venturez Group</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> is backed by over </span><strong style="color: rgb(49, 51, 71);">30 years</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> of experience in construction and redevelopment. Led by </span><strong style="color: rgb(49, 51, 71);">Mr. Vijaykumar M. Parakhiya</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, our in-house team of engineers, supervisors, and sub-contractors ensures seamless execution of large-scale projects using modern technology, in-house materials, and strict quality control guided by expert consultants.</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-empty brz-ff-montserrat brz-ft-google brz-fs-lg-16 brz-fss-lg-px brz-fw-lg-400 brz-ls-lg-0 brz-lh-lg-1_9 brz-vfw-lg-400 brz-fwdth-lg-100 brz-fsft-lg-0 brz-text-lg-justify brz-css-1wrlmtq" data-uniq-id="evauM" data-generated-css="brz-css-wNLRW"><span class="brz-cp-color7">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="brz-tp-lg-empty brz-ff-montserrat brz-ft-google brz-fs-lg-16 brz-fss-lg-px brz-fw-lg-400 brz-ls-lg-0 brz-lh-lg-1_9 brz-vfw-lg-400 brz-fwdth-lg-100 brz-fsft-lg-0 brz-text-lg-justify brz-css-1wrlmtq" data-uniq-id="vyiZL" data-generated-css="brz-css-bPkLH">On the redevelopment front, <strong style="color: rgb(49, 51, 71);">Mr. Vipul B. Sangani</strong> brings over <strong style="color: rgb(49, 51, 71);">18 years</strong> of expertise in society redevelopment, including conveyance, feasibility, MCGM liaisoning, and project sales. Together, our team transforms properties into thoughtfully designed, high-quality spaces that serve both people and progress.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
    
